  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Alternative basic education and vocational training for children and youth in crisis</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Alternative basic education and vocational training are good tools to ease the living conditions for children and youth in crisis, in addition to making them able to be skilled, get an income and an improved lifesituation. Target group is young refugees and the youth in the hosting communities, mainly Shire, as well as urban areas with substantial Eritrean refugee population.</narrative>
  </description>
